  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ERICC final programme evaluation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The evaluation will assess the ERICC programme as a whole, encompassing all four programme components (Research Programme Consortium, Helpdesk, Evidence Dissemination and Uptake, and Knowledge Systems Strengthening) and examining results, partnerships, influence pathways and outcomes at global, regional and country levels. The evaluation is expected to generate findings and recommendations relevant to the overall programme rather than only to a subset of countries.</narrative>
  </description>
